<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JAN 28.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JAN 28.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Tuesday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Jan 28	Jan 27	Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  258.840     256.320     247.020    4.79 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  303.780     303.900     306.830   -0.99 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  156.470     156.560     158.970   -1.57 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.404	46.434	47.182   -1.65 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  417.880     416.280     419.180   -0.31 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  139.325     139.380     141.685   -1.67 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.082	16.075	16.185   -0.64 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  214.290     214.820     212.430    0.88 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.859	 1.861	 1.888   -1.54 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.565	 1.567	 1.581   -1.01 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  180.520     181.085     183.135   -1.43 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the January</p>
<p>02, 1997 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
